5,1,1,talk,Toshio,,The current system is failing. We need a sustainable structure for the next year.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,I am concerned about the time commitment. We need to understand the actual workload.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,The current distribution feels uneven. I want to see where the usage and work align.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,May,,I am tired of guessing the state of the rooms. I want predictability.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Midori,,I care about our relationships. We need a plan that keeps us on speaking terms.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Ryuji, time is a cost. We should look at the data to see the true expense.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Ryuji,,"@Toshio, agreed. I will look into the timing of a full pass to quantify the hours.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,I will check the absences on the wall calendar to see who is actually here.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,May,,I will look at what each housemate counts as done to understand the inconsistency.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Midori,,I will read the note left by the previous tenants to see what went wrong for them.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Toshio,,I will also check the bathroom spray stock and the tin's receipts to see the cash flow.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Ryuji,,I will also check the standard terms of the outside firm to see if outsourcing is viable.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,I will also check a fortnight's watch on kitchen use to see who creates the mess.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,May,,I will also check the bathroom grout after the July scrub to see how fast it degrades.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Midori,,I will also check the rows recorded in the house chat to see where conflicts start.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
