35,2,1,talk,Toshio,,"The receipts show we spend 2,300 yen monthly on supplies, often buying duplicates.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Ryuji,,A full pass takes over two hours. That is a significant chunk of my week.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Benjamin,,The calendar shows two people are away most months. The work is not shared equally.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,May,,"The grout gets dirty in eleven days. The standard for ""done"" varies wildly between us.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Midori,,The previous tenants stopped speaking by year two. The chat logs show reminders cause fights.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Ryuji, if we hire a firm, the management office charges 4,200 yen an hour.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Ryuji,,"@Toshio, the firm requires someone to be home and tidy beforehand. It does not remove the work.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@May, the kitchen mess comes from two or three people. The rest just make coffee.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,May,,"@Benjamin, that explains the inconsistency. I need a system that accounts for usage.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Midori,,"@Toshio, if we pay a firm, we avoid the reminders that start rows.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Toshio,,"The cost of a firm is high, but it removes the supply disputes.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Ryuji,,The time cost of doing it ourselves is too high for me.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Benjamin,,A fixed rota ignores absence. A paid service is neutral.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,May,,A paid service ensures a consistent standard. I don't have to guess.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Midori,,A paid service removes the friction. It protects our harmony.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
